Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 11:36:08 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 023/107] {device,u-boot}-clockworkpi-uconsole-radxa-cm5: move
 from downstream to testing

Move device to testing now that kernel is mainline. U-boot is still
vendored, so does not support EFI boot, a requirement for commmunity
kconfig.

[ci:skip-vercheck]: package moves are considered by pytest-commits as
new packages, which triggers bad checks.

Part-of: <https://gitlab.nura.eco/nura/pmaports/-/merge_requests/8285>
